      "content": "that sounds like a good start. lets dive into the first one, the dress code part. \n\nif someone wants to be seen as \"sophisticated\" or \"high-end\" in a way that is universally understood, what are the actual standards? i dont want people just wearing \"local clothes\" if they want to look like a serious professional. what's the baseline look for a polished, high-status person in a business setting?",
